---
const { section='all' }=Astro.props;
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const photos=[['inventory-open','Novice'],['male-oathkeeper-inventory','Oathkeeper'],['male-highward-inventory','Highward'],['male-mercy-inventory','Mercy'],['male-censure-inventory','Censure'],['male-verdict-inventory','Verdict']];
---
{['all','armor'].includes(section)&&<div class="gallery-grid">{photos.map(([file,name])=><figure><a href={`${base}media/${file}.webp`}><img src={`${base}media/${file}.webp`} alt={`Male Paladin wearing the ${name} armor family in the native inventory during equipment fit review`} width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"/></a><figcaption><strong>{name}</strong> · Paladin 1.3.0 · Native game capture. Expanded review inventory; male idle pose.</figcaption></figure>)}</div>}
{['all','combat'].includes(section)&&<>
<div class="gallery-grid">{[['release-combat-actions','Paladin actions in the native combat interface'],['release-censure-preview','Censure attack preview in native combat'],['release-smite-base','Smite base preview showing 3 damage'],['release-smite-bonus','Smite bonus preview showing 15 damage after Censure Resistance reduction']].map(([file,label])=><figure><a href={`${base}media/${file}.webp`}><img src={`${base}media/${file}.webp`} alt={label} width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"/></a><figcaption>{label}. Native macOS game capture, fixture-assisted equipment. A preview is not final damage.</figcaption></figure>)}</div></>}
{['all','films'].includes(section)&&<>
<p>Four-second studio turntables of original models from the published 1.3.0 package. These show the exported geometry and atlas in studio lighting, not native game animation or character fit. Press Play to loop; use the controls to pause.</p>
<div class="gallery-grid">{[['kingsfall','Kingsfall'],['bastion','The Last Bastion']].map(([file,name])=><figure><video controls loop muted playsinline preload="none" poster={`${base}media/${file}-poster.webp`} aria-label={`${name}: studio equipment turntable, no audio`}><source src={`${base}media/${file}.webm`} type="video/webm"/><source src={`${base}media/${file}.mp4`} type="video/mp4"/><p><a href={`${base}media/${file}.mp4`}>Download {name} studio turntable</a></p></video><figcaption>{name} · Published model, studio animation · Silent. A full rotation shows the front, sides, and back. No autoplay, including when reduced motion is preferred.</figcaption></figure>)}</div></>}
